# Exported identifiers and methods in each internal/ package that no other
# package uses, satisfy no interface and no used type exposes. Counts only
# fall: lower or delete a line when you unexport or delete one. See
# .guards/README.md.
# The package move accepts the existing exports in controller, storage and store
# once. These counts measure declarations newly within internal/, not added code.
